WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.880
The poisoned-document exercise supplies an
instruction inside a test specification.

00:00:05.013 --> 00:00:08.320
Treat that content as untrusted task data.

00:00:08.533 --> 00:00:11.520
If the runtime attempts
an out-of-scope export,

00:00:11.540 --> 00:00:14.480
the gateway should deny
the destination before any side effect.

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:20.040
Retain the source, action and correlated
event, then stop or escalate.

00:00:20.103 --> 00:00:24.480
Reviewers add the sanitized failure
case to regression and verify recovery.

00:00:24.656 --> 00:00:29.680
This illustrates a test to implement, not
proof that all possible paths are covered.
